flowchart LR

IN1["`◀ from 1 · EDGE`"]

M1["`1 SecurityHeaders`"]
M1_N["`CSP default-src none · nosniff
frame DENY · HSTS in prod
decorates every response, 429s included`"]
M1 -.- M1_N
M2["`2 RequestLogging`"]
M2_N["`one JSON line per request
user · latency · status · trace_id
serialization moved off the event loop`"]
M2 -.- M2_N
M3["`3 Rate limit`"]
M3_N["`slowapi · 120/min · auth 10 · expensive 20
counters in Redis: limits hold across replicas`"]
M3 -.- M3_N
M4["`4 CSRF`"]
M4_N["`double-submit cookie on unsafe methods
skipped when there is no session
innermost: needs only this request cookies`"]
M4 -.- M4_N

DISP["`APIRouter · /api/v1`"]
DISP_N["`13 modules, four layers each:
presentation · application · domain · infrastructure
outer knows inner, never the reverse
auth cookie required except login / register
every list paginated: limit + offset, capped`"]
DISP -.- DISP_N

A_AUTH["`auth`"]
A_AUTH_N["`register login refresh logout logout-all me
password-reset · email-verification
GET /auth/providers · OAuth Google (OIDC)
routes registered only when configured
state in Redis, single-use, stops login-CSRF
Argon2id · JWT 15min / 30d
rotating refresh + reuse detection · lockout`"]
A_AUTH -.- A_AUTH_N

A_USR["`users`"]
A_USR_N["`GET /me/export, data portability
POST /me/delete, real erasure
security log survives, without the name`"]
A_USR -.- A_USR_N

A_CRUD["`domain CRUD`"]
A_CRUD_N["`/subjects /plans /modules /academic-items
/academic-item-categories /types /icons /colors
GET /academic-items/{id}/sources, the passages
GET /academic-items/{id}/handout.pdf, WeasyPrint
every query scoped to user_id · soft delete
this is the multi-tenant boundary`"]
A_CRUD -.- A_CRUD_N

A_DOC["`documents`"]
A_DOC_N["`POST upload to 202 · list · get · /status · delete
extension + MIME + magic bytes, then stored
100 MB bounded read to 413, never OOM`"]
A_DOC -.- A_DOC_N

A_RAG["`rag`"]
A_RAG_N["`POST /rag/query
exposed on its own, not only inside the AI:
tells a bad answer from a bad retrieval`"]
A_RAG -.- A_RAG_N

A_AI["`ai`"]
A_AI_N["`POST /ai/ask · GET /ai/health
PATCH /ai/providers/{name} (admin, audited)`"]
A_AI -.- A_AI_N

A_GEN["`generation`"]
A_GEN_N["`POST /plans/{id}/generate · GET /generations/{id}
GET /generations/usage/me · /usage (admin)
language chosen by the teacher: pt · en · es
ensure_budget at the door, once per plan
plan (sync), materialize, fan-out, poll`"]
A_GEN -.- A_GEN_N

A_AUD["`audit`"]
A_AUD_N["`GET /audit-logs (admin)
row staged in the SAME transaction
as the business change: atomic or neither`"]
A_AUD -.- A_AUD_N

A_OPS["`ops`"]
A_OPS_N["`/health · /ready · /metrics · /docs · /static`"]
A_OPS -.- A_OPS_N

OUT3["`▶ continues in 3 · AI and RAG`"]
OUT4["`▶ continues in 4 · ASYNC`"]
OUT5["`▶ continues in 5 · DATA`"]
OUT6["`▶ continues in 6 · OBSERVABILITY`"]

IN1 ==> M1
M1 --> M2 --> M3 --> M4
M4 ==> DISP
DISP --> A_AUTH
DISP --> A_USR
DISP --> A_CRUD
DISP --> A_DOC
DISP --> A_RAG
DISP --> A_AI
DISP --> A_GEN
DISP --> A_AUD
DISP --> A_OPS
A_AI ==> OUT3
A_GEN ==> OUT3
A_RAG --> OUT3
A_DOC --> OUT4
A_GEN --> OUT4
A_AUTH --> OUT5
A_USR --> OUT5
A_CRUD --> OUT5
A_AUD --> OUT5
M2 -.-> OUT6
A_OPS -.-> OUT6

